	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S[alutem] p[lurimam] d[ico].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Duram quidem, venerande praeceptor, provinciam imponis, ut sententiam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>de <persName ref="p4252">Gaspari</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="1"><persName ref="p4252">Kaspar Baumgartner</persName>, gest. nach 6. April 1540, kam am 30. September 1538 als Stipendiat an die Lateinschule in <placeName ref="l242">Kappel</placeName>. Im Frühjahr 1540 wurde er in die Fraumünsterschule in der Stadt versetzt, starb aber wohl kurz darauf an der Pest. - Lit.: Zürich StA, E I 14. 1, Fasz. 2.</note> ingenio perscribam, quod emunctum iuditium tuum minime <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>latere censeo, siquidem ex oratione infallibilibus coniecturis vidisti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>officii mei non immemor observata nostrae mentis adumbrabo, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>partim ut studuerit, partim ut convixerit, e quibus tanquam e fimbria <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>de textura<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 136, Nr. 663.</note> iudicabis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Musas visus est habere non iniquiores; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>noluit enim in reddenda lectione postremus haberi neque in excolenda <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>memoria ab aequalibus vinci.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tum in stilo exercendo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hactenus diligentior repertus quam felicior, ausimque affirmare <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>id posse facile sarciri, posteaquam frequentem lectionem et usum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>artificio coniunxerit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Facit et illud, ut in spem optimam erigar <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et studio adcommodum fore colligam, quod doctissimorum est <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>admirator, tum a pietatis negocio minime alienus, quasi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>indoles affinitatem quandam resipiat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Haec de literis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nunc, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ut mores et vitae actio his respondeant, paucis subnectam: <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Non aliud pro comperto referre possum quam integrum esse adu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>lescentem et dolo malo neutiquam consutum, alioquin confidens, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>irritabilis, loquens et qui fere manu faciem absterserit, ut <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>saeculum nostrum habet, quae tamen praevalente intellectu, tum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>augescente eruditione reprimentur; nam et in eo virtutis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tincturam notavi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Haec candido animo accipe; pro virili <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>voti compotem reddere volui nolimque immerito quenquam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>male audire, nedum discipulum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale feliciter in Christo.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>1539, e Capella <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName>, 18. septembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p8006">Ioannes Liberianus</persName> tuus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>obedientissimus.<pb type="edition" next="220"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf S. 814:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Venerando <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>antistiti M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, patrono <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>summo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
